{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02YJ", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{P}(f) =$", "MATH_0002": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-descending-property-integral}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:365d02bf050f12ee9903b36c61bdf624d00b07c1586052591e25ad225aaf043e", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:412e07970dd39302dd0cb772fecf7a68d276ee5bed33b6c9f1d73f6f9a5da7a1", "source_text": "The property <MATH_0001>``<MATH_0002> is integral''\nis fpqc local on the base.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:bca84f01aa9ac997fb14d90fd622533560294650401b8f4c5751f6dfff70fb46", "unit_id": "tag:02L9:statement"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "02YJ", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-integral-universally-closed}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-descending-property-universally-closed}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-descending-property-affine}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d7392200a147c562efa6c200ffeaea9dc1000a0581d8953b54dc2b726418ce6e", "source_text": "An integral morphism is the same thing as an affine,\nuniversally closed morphism. See\nMorphisms, Lemma <REF_0001>.\nHence the lemma follows on combining\nLemmas <REF_0002>\nand <REF_0003>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:25f5b6134e47434fd66d7210c46ed31a717d8027d04d944f0b2b288b827a5b78", "unit_id": "tag:02L9:proof"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02YJ", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{P}(f) =$", "MATH_0002": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-descending-property-finite}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:365d02bf050f12ee9903b36c61bdf624d00b07c1586052591e25ad225aaf043e", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:29b932fc8859d9f3b4ba32cc9565e0b073903881e6780333692ac3c41949a143", "source_text": "The property <MATH_0001>``<MATH_0002> is finite''\nis fpqc local on the base.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0bc82be2c675b6cbf64c690d995d2b468108965661b364d01a2cb03a6f840fe2", "unit_id": "tag:02LA:statement"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "02YJ", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-finite-integral}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-descending-property-locally-finite-type}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-descending-property-integral}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7e912f339437b7f06fe16c5738deddf5e42a2d366576261a187ef9d59b9b60cd", "source_text": "An finite morphism is the same thing as an integral\nmorphism which is locally of finite type. See\nMorphisms, Lemma <REF_0001>.\nHence the lemma follows on combining\nLemmas <REF_0002>\nand <REF_0003>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e1613920246384ccc89497ece19cee173fa2ea2cd1683021d187a56fbd6860cb", "unit_id": "tag:02LA:proof"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02YJ", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{P}(f) =$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{P}(f) =$", "MATH_0004": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-descending-property-quasi-finite}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:501114b2d297719bfc5dd1e65f11cc93ff1b75a4b7f1819c10c431f6eb9c4f23", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e94cbe14e4f020564d6aadc0daa74b1df4295bada62f92176339600fc0b45b87", "source_text": "The properties\n<MATH_0001>``<MATH_0002> is locally quasi-finite''\nand\n<MATH_0003>``<MATH_0004> is quasi-finite''\nare fpqc local on the base.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b74d7e410f6b61f3fdefa5fe9d25c769c06212ae27621b787c8667a9078c7da4", "unit_id": "tag:02VI:statement"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "02YJ", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\{S_i \\to S\\}$", "MATH_0003": "$f_i : X_i \\to S_i$", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "MATH_0005": "$f$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-descending-property-locally-finite-type}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-base-change-quasi-finite}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-descending-property-quasi-compact}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:1b13bf9b009f2dc40e42758435d3e08287a8f1f9bce1f9755e3a1e4f94bab5cc", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f3f74643e9fd0692b16dfed6edcfa4b415da5f2e9e27cc60eafbf9bd53089a5d", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes, and let <MATH_0002>\nbe an fpqc covering such that each base change\n<MATH_0003> is locally quasi-finite.\nWe have already seen\n(Lemma <REF_0001>)\nthat ``locally of finite type'' is fpqc local\non the base, and hence we see that <MATH_0004> is locally of finite type.\nThen it follows from\nMorphisms, Lemma <REF_0002>\nthat <MATH_0005> is locally quasi-finite. The quasi-finite case follows\nas we have already seen that ``quasi-compact'' is fpqc local on the base\n(Lemma <REF_0003>).\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:944cd64798071a742af4ce5204809a9520c71d9e9997280ed94f15f13885e515", "unit_id": "tag:02VI:proof"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02YJ", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{P}(f) =$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$d$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-descending-property-relative-dimension-d}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:4639983170e17b823bed9919b7590c108e4644e25680a735aea1b39110ef0777", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:3813159fb171b426e04ada9c77bd9534a2a5ffea6732497c16dfee4c33e2020a", "source_text": "The property <MATH_0001>``<MATH_0002> is locally of finite type\nof relative dimension <MATH_0003>'' is fpqc local on the base.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7357ee83f07e2468176ec68700f9830a59084d71fa4776ea58fbba0f783fbfed", "unit_id": "tag:02VJ:statement"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "02YJ", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-dimension-fibre-after-base-change}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:2396f429b4a8531993cee8cbf2817593c437ae1feb4145915165e1649dc76c68", "source_text": "This follows immediately from the fact that being locally of finite\ntype is fpqc local on the base and\nMorphisms, Lemma <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:6c1e93e615cc7cba65ed296cfcd069b3275714b9597f550d23ec5538ab161819", "unit_id": "tag:02VJ:proof"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02YJ", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{P}(f) =$", "MATH_0002": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-descending-property-syntomic}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:365d02bf050f12ee9903b36c61bdf624d00b07c1586052591e25ad225aaf043e", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:99ff4d8dde1531e4ae0d628f2a34979663083838ec2b1f28e42f42164fd00d5a", "source_text": "The property <MATH_0001>``<MATH_0002> is syntomic''\nis fpqc local on the base.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:581b0469ad56dcf2e1176eac2047a3b9556e038ea6ed8e37902ea8acfa0313bd", "unit_id": "tag:02VK:statement"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "02YJ", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-descending-property-flat}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-descending-property-locally-finite-presentation}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-set-points-where-fibres-lci}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:0b70eead87f04296e4694bc1487e6fc4801813bd18b945fe8319d639a3987e18", "source_text": "A morphism is syntomic if and only if it is locally of finite presentation,\nflat, and has locally complete intersections as fibres. We have seen\nalready that being flat and locally of finite presentation are\nfpqc local on the base (Lemmas\n<REF_0001>, and\n<REF_0002>).\nHence the result follows for syntomic from\nMorphisms, Lemma <REF_0003>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:155355f65f4fd45d37f837823fe94a9783b1745e8103cc0d03685094cd708d29", "unit_id": "tag:02VK:proof"}
